STRING 2022
{
Game Commands (Capitalization necessary when included below):

-cam	                Height offset of 600
-cam1	                Height offset of 1000
-cam2	                3rd person view of hero
-camduel	                3rd person view of random arena unit
-camlock                  Lock camera target to player's hero ('alt c' to unlock)

-c	                 Count sand + sound jounin
-show	                 Show names on multiboard
-hide	                 Hide names on multiboard

Naruto Only:
-r	                Sends clones to randomly move
-a	                Sends clones to randomly attack
-f                              Orders clones to follow(right-click) Naruto
-auto                        Sends clones out each time they are created
-autof                       Orders clones to follow(right-click) Naruto each time they are created
-off                           Turns off auto

Sand Heros (During Invasion Only):
-f                              Summons all jounin of player color to follow the hero
-KabutoOn               Turns on Kabuto's AI controls
-KabutoOff               Disables Kabuto's AI controls
-GaaraOn                 Turns on Gaara's AI controls
-GaaraOff                 Disables Gaara's AI controls
-KankuroOn             Turns on Kankuro's AI controls
-KankuroOff             Disables Kankuro's AI controls
-TemariOn                Turns on Temari's AI controls
-TemariOff                Disables Temari's AI controls

Sasuke Only (While in Orochimaru's Hideout):

-Kabuto                    Changes control to Sasuke

Kiba Only (If he becomes glitched):

-fix                        Unglitches Kiba if Shikyaku no Jutsu is permanently on

Host Only:
-mo	            Current music off
-NoRamen           Disallows the use of ramen during tournaments.
-ShareComp         Forces all player slots controlled by a computer to share control.
KickName            Kicks the player of named character from the game.
KillName               Kills the hero representing the named character.
}
