STRING 2673
{
During the Forest of Death event, a team should try to acquire one heaven and one earth scroll. One member of the team should then enter the tower ONLY during the last 2 minutes of the countdown.
Scrolls are not necessary to continue the game. However, heros will be awarded +3 levels for accomplishing the Forest of Death.
}
